    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d230">

                <pb facs="0321" n="215" xml:id="pg215"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.6131/335a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bullitt</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-07-15T17:00:00-04:00">July 15, 1935—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>154. For Bullitt from Secretary Morgenthau. Congratulations on breaking the log
                    jam between the United States and Russia.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>[For text of the agreement effected by exchange of notes July 13, 1935, see
                        Department of State Executive Agreement Series No. 81, or 49 Stat. 3805. For
                        text of press release issued by the Department of State, July 13, 1935, see
                        Department of State, <hi rendition="#italic">Press Releases</hi>, July 13,
                        1935, page 45.]</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
